    "title": "MJF vs. Rush AEW World Title Match & More Set For Next Week's Dynamite, Saturday's Collision Lineup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mango ,\n57 minutes ago\nThis Saturday, the latter half of AEW Collision takes place at the Von Braun Center in Huntsville, Alabama. Announced for the show are the following matches:\nAEW World Trios Championship Match: The Conglomeration (Orange Cassidy, Kyle O’Reilly, and Roderick Strong) (c) vs. The Don Callis Family’s Lance Archer, Rocky Romero and Trent Beretta The status of the AEW TBS Championship will be addressed 5-Minute Tag Team Championship Eliminator: The Divine Dominion vs. TayJay Next week’s episode of AEW Dynamite will take place at the Siegel Center in Richmond, Virginia. Here is what has been advertised for the June 3rd episode:\nAEW World Championship Match: MJF (c) vs. RUSH Owen Hart Foundation Tournament First-Round Match: Alex Windsor vs. TBA Wild Card Owen Hart Foundation Tournament Semifinals Match: Will Ospreay vs. Mark Davis AEW TNT Championship Match: “The Jet” Kevin Knight (c) vs. “Speedball” Mike Bailey Stay tuned for live coverage brought to you by eWrestlingNews.com for both of those shows. In the meantime, drop your comments below with your predictions on who you think will win these matches!",
    "summary": "This Saturday, the latter half of AEW Collision takes place at the Von Braun Center in Huntsville, Alabama. Announced for the show are the following matches: AEW World Trios Championship Match: The Conglomeration (Orange Cassidy, Kyle O’Reilly, and Roderick Strong) (c) vs. The Don Callis Family’s Lance Archer, Rocky Romero and Trent Beretta The status of the AEW TBS Championship will be addressed 5-Minute Tag Team Championship Eliminator: The Divine Dominion vs. TayJay Next week’s episode of AEW Dynamite will take place at the Siegel Center in Richmond, Virginia.",
